# Linux temp files
*~

# Windows x86-64 local-only leftovers. On x86-64, DynamicHooks and HDE64 are
# compiled from source directly into core (see
# src/makefiles/win32/win32.base.cmake), so a locally produced win64
# DynamicHooks static lib and scratch disassembly/log files must never be
# committed. The vendored AsmJit/boost/dyncall archives under
# src/thirdparty/<dep>/lib/win64 ARE tracked build inputs and are deliberately
# NOT matched by these anchored rules.
/src/thirdparty/DynamicHooks/lib/win64/
/disasm_bridge.py
/sp_console_calls.log
